Scope of this license

This license covers the original work in this repository: the Director runtime
emulator (src/runtime), the data extractor and tools, the verification
harness, tests and documentation.

It does not grant any rights in "Teen Titans: Battle Blitz" itself. The game's
code, artwork, animation, sound, music, characters and trademarks belong to
their respective owners (Warner Bros. Discovery, Cartoon Network, DC). The game
classes in src/game are a reimplementation of the original game's logic for
interoperability and preservation and are provided without any claim of
ownership over the original work. This repository contains no game data;
players must supply their own copy of the original release.
